msgid "显示与图形接口"
msgstr "Display and graphics interfaces"

msgid "设备能力"
msgstr "Device capabilities"

msgid ""
"ReliefNT 提供 framebuffer、VT 与有限的 Linux DRM/vmwgfx 路线。 硬件和权限允许时提供 card/render 节点；必须处理缺设备、不支持的 ioctl、"
" 超时和中断。用户属于 video 组并不保证所有 GPU 功能可用。 SVGA-II/VGPU9、同设备 PRIME 与通用跨设备 DMA-BUF 是不同范围。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefNT provides framebuffer, VT, and limited Linux DRM/vmwgfx paths. card/render nodes are "
"provided when hardware and permissions allow; handle missing devices, unsupported ioctls, "
"timeouts, and interrupts. Membership in video does not guarantee all GPU features. SVGA-II/VGPU9, "
"same-device PRIME, and generic cross-device DMA-BUF have different scopes."

msgid "应用集成"
msgstr "Application integration"

msgid ""
"X11 应用设置标准 desktop、MIME、图标与 WM_CLASS/_NET_WM_ICON 等适用信息。 FLTK 应用保留系统控件、主题和中文字体；功能内容区不放重复的大程序标题。 "
"窗口、输入与状态更新不得被磁盘操作或网络连接长期阻塞，长操作走 worker。 XDM 与 IceWM 的独立主题策略见 :doc:`../admin-guide/desktop`。"
msgstr ""
"X11 applications set applicable standard desktop, MIME, icon, and WM_CLASS/_NET_WM_ICON "
"information. FLTK applications retain system widgets, themes, and Chinese fonts; avoid redundant "
"large application titles in functional content areas. Disk operations or network connections must "
"not block windows, input, and state updates for long periods; use workers for long operations. For"
" separate XDM and IceWM theme policies, see :doc:`../admin-guide/desktop`."

msgid "内核显示驱动源码位于 ``kernel/reliefnt/drivers/``，不消费旧中间层实现。"
msgstr ""
"Kernel display-driver sources are in ``kernel/reliefnt/drivers/`` and do not consume the old "
"intermediate-layer implementation."
